| Feature                  | How to Add                                                      |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Instanced Rendering      | Batch contexts with identical VAO + material + transform buffer |
| View Frustum Culling     | Check AABB vs frustum before calling `submit()`                 |
| Sorting Transparent Pass | Sort `RenderContext`s by camera-space depth                     |
| Render to Texture        | Add `Framebuffer*` to context or engine                         |

